  "body": "The decNumber library subtracts the exponents of two numbers, we make sure to limit the number of digits not to make it overflows. Since the maximum adjusted exponent is `emax` and the minimum is `emin - digits + 1`, we follow `emax - (emin - digits + 1) <= INT32_MAX`. Resolves #2825.",
